<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath up 3.33 pct on active buying.</title>
<headline>Sampath up 3.33 pct on active buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sampath Bank Ltd rose 3.33 percent or two rupees to 62 on heavy buying in early Friday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Small investors, who favour the share due to its high liquidity and low price, are buying since it has come down from this year's high of 65 rupees,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The scrip fell back from 65 rupees on profit-taking in the Past two days, he said.</p>
<p>Sampath Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
